/F1 10 Tf (I, Adrian Vale, of Blackthorn House, being of sound mind and suspicious) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (disposition, declare this to be my last will. It revokes every earlier will,) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (including the one I wrote on a napkin in 1998.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Article 1. Blackthorn House. The house and its grounds pass to the Vale) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Family Trust, for the use of my family. The thermostat stays where I set it.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Article 2. Blackthorn Security. My voting shares in Blackthorn Security pass) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (to my children, Evelyn Vale and Marcus Vale, in equal parts. They may vote) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (them however they like, provided they do it in the same room.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Article 3. Bequests. To my niece, Nina Park, I leave my books and the right) Tj T*
